{"seq":2,"slug":"curse-dimensionality","title":"维度诅咒：KDE 在高维为什么注定失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/curse-dimensionality","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"维度诅咒-kde-在高维为什么注定失效\">维度诅咒：KDE 在高维为什么注定失效</h1><p>一维 KDE 用几百个样本就能画出漂亮的密度曲线；同样的精度，到了十维，你需要的样本量可能超过全宇宙原子数的量级。这不是夸张，是维度诅咒在密度估计上的冷酷算术。<a href=\"multivariate-kde\">多元 KDE</a> 展示了如何把 KDE 抬到高维，这一篇要说清楚为什么抬上去之后它基本就废了——以及这个结论如何决定实践中的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>维度诅咒是 KDE 最大的软肋。本篇沿三条线展开：收敛速率指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{d+4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随维度趋零导致样本需求指数膨胀、几何根源是高维空间空旷使「局部平均」失去意义、以及由此推出的实践出路（降维、结构假设、换模型）。一条铁律贯穿全文——诅咒改的是指数，任何工程技巧只能改常数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛速率随维度退化\">收敛速率随维度退化</h2><p>回顾一维 <a href=\"../foundations/kde-model\">KDE 定义</a>：最优带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h^*\\propto n^{-1/5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优 MISE <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto n^{-4/5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把这套 AMISE 分析推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维，最优带宽和最优误差变成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mtext>MISE</mtext><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h^* \\propto n^{-1/(d+4)}, \\qquad \\text{MISE}^* \\propto n^{-4/(d+4)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MISE</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7619em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>收敛速率的指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{d+4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随维度迅速趋近于零。一维是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/5=0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>，二维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.67</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/6\\approx0.67</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.67</span></span></span></span></span>，五维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/9\\approx0.44</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.44</span></span></span></span></span>，十维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>14</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.29</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/14\\approx0.29</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/14</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.29</span></span></span></span></span>。指数越小，收敛越慢，意味着同样的精度需要指数级更多的样本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>MISE 速率指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{d+4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>达到一维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 同等精度所需样本量（数量级）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.67</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2.4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{2.4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0.57</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2.8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{2.8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>0.44</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3.6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{3.6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3.6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>0.29</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5.5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{5.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>0.17</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9.4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{9.4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表是全篇的核心：要在十维保持一维百样本的精度，得约三十万样本；二十维则要几十亿。密度估计是被维度诅咒打击得最狠的任务之一，比回归、分类都严重，因为它要还原整个高维空间上的函数，而非某个低维投影或决策边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么会这样-空间的空旷\">为什么会这样：空间的空旷</h2><p>维度诅咒的几何直觉是「高维空间极度空旷」。考虑单位超立方体里均匀撒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，要让每个点的邻域里平均有固定数量的样本（KDE 的核平滑正需要邻域里有足够样本），邻域边长必须随维度增大。若想让一个边长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的小立方体平均含固定比例的样本，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 须固定，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>const</mtext><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = (\\text{const})^{1/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">const</span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——维度一高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 迅速逼近 1，也就是说「局部邻域」不得不膨胀到几乎覆盖整个空间才能凑够样本。局部性一旦丧失，KDE 的核平滑就失去意义：它本质上是在做局部平均，而高维里没有真正的「局部」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[高维空间] --&gt; B[固定样本数 n]&#10;    B --&gt; C[要邻域含足够样本]&#10;    C --&gt; D[邻域边长 r 正比 n 分之常数 开 d 次方]&#10;    D --&gt; E[d 大则 r 趋近 1]&#10;    E --&gt; F[局部邻域膨胀到覆盖全空间]&#10;    F --&gt; G[丧失局部性]&#10;    G --&gt; H[核平滑失效&lt;br/&gt;KDE 崩溃]&#10;    D --&gt; I[另一后果: 数据几乎都在边界带]&#10;    I --&gt; J[边界偏差主导]\">flowchart TD\n    A[高维空间] --&gt; B[固定样本数 n]\n    B --&gt; C[要邻域含足够样本]\n    C --&gt; D[邻域边长 r 正比 n 分之常数 开 d 次方]\n    D --&gt; E[d 大则 r 趋近 1]\n    E --&gt; F[局部邻域膨胀到覆盖全空间]\n    F --&gt; G[丧失局部性]\n    G --&gt; H[核平滑失效&lt;br/&gt;KDE 崩溃]\n    D --&gt; I[另一后果: 数据几乎都在边界带]\n    I --&gt; J[边界偏差主导]</pre><p>另一个后果与 <a href=\"../kernels/boundary-bias\">边界偏差</a> 相连：高维超立方体的绝大部分体积集中在靠近表面的薄壳里，于是几乎所有样本都落在边界区域，边界偏差从局部问题升级为全局主导问题。两个诅咒叠加，高维 KDE 雪上加霜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践后果与出路\">实践后果与出路</h2><p>维度诅咒不是理论洁癖，它直接改写实践决策。经验上，<strong>纯 KDE 在超过约 5 到 6 维时基本不可靠</strong>——除非你有海量样本或密度极其光滑。面对高维密度估计需求，有几条现实出路。</p>\n<p><strong>先降维再 KDE</strong>。用 PCA、UMAP 等把数据压到 2 到 3 维，再在低维空间做 KDE。这是最常见的组合，代价是降维会丢失信息、且低维密度未必对应高维密度。降维方法本身也是被维度诅咒逼出来的，其原理见 <a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/foundations/curse-of-dimensionality\">维度诅咒（降维篇）</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>结构假设换灵活性</strong>。放弃「完全非参数」，引入结构：假设各维条件独立（朴素贝叶斯式）、或用图模型分解联合密度、或用 copula 把边缘与依赖分离建模。这些都是在用假设换取样本效率，正是参数与非参数之间的中间地带。</p>\n<p><strong>换更适合高维的密度模型</strong>。混合高斯、normalizing flows 等参数/半参数模型在高维远比 KDE 抗打，因为它们不靠局部平均。当维度较高时，这些常是更好的选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>出路</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>降维 + KDE</td>\n<td>PCA/UMAP 压到 2-3 维再估</td>\n<td>丢信息、低维密度≠高维密度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构假设</td>\n<td>条件独立 / 图模型 / copula</td>\n<td>假设可能不成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换模型</td>\n<td>混合高斯 / normalizing flows</td>\n<td>需训练、可解释性下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应带宽</td>\n<td>稠密处细、稀疏处粗</td>\n<td>只缓解不根治维度诅咒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条——<a href=\"adaptive-kde\">自适应带宽</a>——能在中等维度缓解稀疏区的方差，但它改变不了收敛速率的指数，治标不治本。记住这条铁律：维度诅咒改的是指数，任何工程技巧都只能改常数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维最优带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto n^{-1/(d+4)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最优 MISE <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto n^{-4/(d+4)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，速率指数随维度趋零，样本需求指数膨胀。</li>\n<li>几何根源是高维空间空旷：凑够邻域样本所需的邻域膨胀到覆盖全空间，局部性丧失，核平滑失效；且样本几乎全在边界壳里。</li>\n<li>经验上纯 KDE 超过 5 到 6 维基本不可靠。</li>\n<li>出路是降维后再 KDE、引入结构假设、或换混合高斯/normalizing flows；自适应带宽只缓解不根治，因为诅咒改的是指数不是常数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>缓解稀疏区方差的自适应方案：<a href=\"adaptive-kde\">自适应带宽</a></li>\n<li>高维 KDE 的形式基础：<a href=\"multivariate-kde\">多元 KDE</a></li>\n<li>降维如何对抗同一个诅咒：<a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/foundations/curse-of-dimensionality\">维度诅咒（降维篇）</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维度诅咒：KDE 在高维为什么注定失效","id":"维度诅咒-kde-在高维为什么注定失效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛速率随维度退化","id":"收敛速率随维度退化"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么会这样：空间的空旷","id":"为什么会这样-空间的空旷"},{"level":2,"text":"实践后果与出路","id":"实践后果与出路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"多元 KDE：从标量带宽到带宽矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/multivariate-kde"},"next":{"title":"自适应带宽：稠密处精细，稀疏处平滑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/multivariate/adaptive-kde"}}